  "body": "[GEMglBindTexture] calls glBindTexture() each time a gemlist passes through it, with the parameters set by its creation arguments and inlets. GL constants are numbers here: [GLdefine] turns a name like GL_LINES into its value. See glBindTexture in the OpenGL reference."
